The full text of the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 must be
appended below this notice. Fetch it once with:

    curl -o /tmp/agpl.txt https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt
    cat /tmp/agpl.txt >> COPYING

It is omitted here only to keep this scaffold small. Do not ship without it.
